WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960
Speaker 1: One other Russia Ukraine story I want&nbsp;
to mention this made big headlines over the last&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:13.520
24 hours, and the headline is Russian airstrike&nbsp;
has hit a Ukrainian maternity hospital. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:20.800
Associated Press is reporting a Russian airstrike&nbsp;
devastated a maternity hospital Wednesday&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:27.920
in the besieged port city of Mariupol amid growing&nbsp;
warnings from the West that Moscow's invasion is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:33.920
about to take a more brutal and indiscriminate&nbsp;
turn. Ukrainian officials said the attack wounded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.800
at least 17 people. The ground shook more than&nbsp;
a mile away when the Mariupol complex was hit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:47.680
by a series of blasts that blew out windows and&nbsp;
ripped away much of the front of one building.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:55.280
Vladimir Nicolin, a top regional police official&nbsp;
standing in the ruins, said today Russia committed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:02.480
a huge crime. It is a war crime without any&nbsp;
justification. This story alone is generating a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:08.240
ton of discussion about what is the truth here. On&nbsp;
the one hand, there was the reaction that Russia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:14.640
is now deliberately bombing maternity hospitals,&nbsp;
and we saw the head of the airstrike against an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:19.600
orphanage last week and against the Children's&nbsp;
Hospital last week. So one perspective is they're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:25.120
doing this on purpose to wreak havoc and cause&nbsp;
terror. The counterpoint was it is of no advantage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:30.800
whatsoever to Putin to deliberately strike a&nbsp;
maternity hospital. What would be the point?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:37.840
Obviously, Russia doesn't think that pregnant&nbsp;
mothers and health care workers and newborn babies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:43.200
are the ones waging the war against them, so they&nbsp;
would never deliberately hit a maternity hospital.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:49.200
If they did, it must be indifference or lack&nbsp;
of precision. However, the latest that I've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:55.760
read is Russia is claiming that the maternity&nbsp;
ward was being used as a state, as a staging&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:03.120
area for Ukrainian troops and volunteers, et&nbsp;
cetera, and that there were not actually any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:08.400
pregnant women in the maternity ward at the time,&nbsp;
and that when Ukraine says our maternity ward was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:13.280
hit, that it's merely propaganda because everybody&nbsp;
knows that it's actually a military staging area.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:21.040
Do we ultimately know the truth? Maybe,&nbsp;
maybe. I certainly don't know it right now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:25.760
and I'm open to it being any of the above&nbsp;
that I just mentioned. But I think the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:32.880
important takeaway from individual stories like&nbsp;
this are that it is complete and total. Chaos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:40.080
and that this is still an optional invasion&nbsp;
by Russia, and so it's very easy, you know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:44.720
I look at these discussions that happen online and&nbsp;
people are getting extraordinarily flustered and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:49.920
angry with each other and adversarial over. No,&nbsp;
no, no. This was obviously deliberate. No, no,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:54.480
no. Obviously, Russia would never deliberately&nbsp;
hit a maternity ward. It goes against their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.480 --> 00:03:00.080
strategic objectives and it goes against their&nbsp;
PR objectives as well. I don't think we know. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:05.280
one of the things that we are seeing is when&nbsp;
folks get involved in the minutia and I'm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:10.160
not saying we don't care whether a maternity&nbsp;
ward was hit. Obviously, we do. And obviously,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.400
people are getting wounded and people are&nbsp;
dying, and 17 wounded is supposedly the number&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:20.960
from this particular incident. When you get&nbsp;
bogged down in the details, the point is you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:25.840
end up fighting with people assuming that their&nbsp;
good faith actor is now if they're just, you know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:30.240
Russian trolls pro Russian trolls, OK, then&nbsp;
then it's that that's a different story. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:34.240
when you get bogged down in the in the&nbsp;
specifics of what happened in this one incident,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:41.520
it's very easy to lose the main thread,&nbsp;
which is this is an optional, premeditated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:51.400
invasion of aggression of Ukraine by Russia.&nbsp;
And when we end up arguing with people about why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:56.880
would would Russia deliberately do this&nbsp;
if they knew that there were not actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:02.000
Ukrainian troops there or if they did, or if we&nbsp;
end up missing that big picture? And that's the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:06.400
big picture that we have to remember. And quite&nbsp;
frankly, going back to the previous segment, I did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:13.440
that big picture of an optional premeditated&nbsp;
invasion of aggression by Russia to try to take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:17.280
land or to install a puppet government.&nbsp;
Whatever, ultimately, is Putin's goal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:24.560
That's the big picture that has united the West&nbsp;
and American allies and Naito allies. And so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:30.640
we want to know what happened here. We do. And it&nbsp;
matters what happened here. It doesn't change the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:34.000
big picture of what's going on in the region,&nbsp;
and I think that's the important takeaway.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:38.320
Let me know your thoughts. You&nbsp;
can find me on Twitter at Packman.

